+// Import pages to a FPDF_DOCUMENT.
+//
+//   dest_doc  - The destination document for the pages.
+//   src_doc   - The document to be imported.
+//   pagerange - A page range string, Such as "1,3,5-7". If |pagerange| is NULL,
